CARD RUN BLACKJACK 20x - PAR SHEET (lab pack)
Build: card-run-blackjack-classic-launch.html  sha256 381595b2ec0103398f92886e7429afc9624c3a53d6e68ebcd7e86fde01f2708c  131,176 bytes
Model: infinite deck (every card drawn from 13 ranks, the build's newShoe), four hands v one dealer (one card up, draws after the
hands, stands on all 17s). Choices on hard 12-16 and soft 17. Ties win; BJ v dealer BJ ties (BJ column pays); dealer BJ beats the rest.
Pays (x bet, all three columns add): WINS 2/3/4 = 0.3/1.2/2 · MADE 21 1/2/3/4 = 0.4/1/2/4 · BJ 1/2/3/4 = 0.5/2/10/18. Rounded down to the cent.
Bets $1.00-$100.00 in $0.10 steps · max win 20,000x the bet · minimum $0.02 for DOUBLE OR NOTHING / DOUBLE HALF · run cap 1,000x the first win

