6. DOUBLE OR NOTHING THROUGH THE SHIPPED CODE (runGame of the final build, one resolved hand per call)
best play                            10,000,000 hands (10 jobs, crypto 5101-5110): win chance 50.0673%, RTP 100.135% [100.073%, 100.197%], exact 100.0910% inside (z 1.38); pushes 422,055 in 10,422,055 deals = 4.050% [4.038%, 4.062%], exact 4.052% inside.
basic strategy (conventional chart)  10,000,000 hands (10 jobs, crypto 5201-5210): win chance 50.0494%, RTP 100.099% [100.037%, 100.161%], exact 100.0721% inside (z 0.85); pushes 416,448 in 10,416,448 deals = 3.998% [3.986%, 4.010%], exact 4.000% inside.
One resolved hand pays 0 or 2x the stake, so its sample SD is 1.00: 10 million hands put the RTP only to +-0.06 points (the edge is 0.09): the shipped-code test shows consistency with the exact value, not the sign of the edge by itself. The exact value is the evaluator (rungame.js) and the rig tests (browser_smoke.js).

